OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of Glasgow City Council
OL,4,Astaff still do not know if their pay
OL,5,Awill be cut
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of Glasgow City Council
OL,8,Fworkers still do not know what their
OL,9,Fwages will be under a controversial new
OL,10,Fpay structure being implemented by the
OL,11,Flocal authority.
OL,13,FThe council announced last week it
OL,14,Fintended to fire and re-hire all its
OL,15,Fnon-teaching staff after talks with
OL,16,Funions over new pay grades fell apart,
OL,17,Fonly to pause the plan the following
OL,18,Fday.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
