OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of Glasgow City Council
OL,4,Astaff still do not know if their pay
OL,5,Awill be cut
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowever several workers have since
OL,8,Fcontacted BBC Your Voice to say they
OL,9,Fhave still not had their job evaluation
OL,10,Fcarried out yet, with no timescale for
OL,11,Fthis given to them yet.
OL,13,FThis means staff face the possibility
OL,14,Fof being given new contracts, without
OL,15,Fknowing how much they would be earning.
